  "details": "For example, if you were to need to make a world that can connect via websocket to the Jackbox.tv server, 1. it'd need to be allowed, and 2. it might send a lot more requests than allowed currently by vrc. To allow for worlds to do a lot more in many situations, could the funtionality be added sometime to allow for such connections if they are requested + very trustworthy?\n\nAdding in the ability to connect to jackbox.tv specifically would make streaming jackbox to a player in the world, then playing with friends more fun, since quest could (maybe) join too, and you don't need to go to a steam dashboard to type answers and such.",
